{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17265,\"date\":\"2026-08-29T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-29T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-mac-mini-mac-studio-con-macos-golden-gate\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Mac mini e Mac Studio in arrivo con macOS Golden Gate\",\"excerpt\":\"I nuovi Mac mini e Mac Studio annunciati da Apple sarebbero predisposti per arrivare con macOS Golden Gate, grazie a riferimenti alle funzioni di Siri AI nelle pagine prodotto e alle tempistiche di rilascio.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17257,\"date\":\"2026-08-28T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-28T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"safari-technology-preview-251-update-bug-fix-performance\",\"title\":\"Safari Technology Preview 251: update con correzioni e miglioramenti\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia Safari Technology Preview 251, l’anteprima sperimentale di Safari. Disponibile via Aggiornamento software, è compatibile con le ultime versioni di macOS e punta a raccogliere feedback da sviluppatori e utenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17198,\"date\":\"2026-08-26T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-26T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"home-hub-codice-suggerisce-cambio-profilo-ambient-sensing\",\"title\":\"Home Hub: il codice suggerisce il cambio profilo basato sull’identità\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel codice dell’aggiornamento macOS Tahoe 26.7 emergono riferimenti a “Personal Content” e “ambient sensing”, con possibili cambi profilo automatici per utenti diversi in casa.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-AI-Command-Center-Concept-Mock-3-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-AI-Command-Center-Concept-Mock-3\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17162,\"date\":\"2026-08-24T22:35:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-24T20:35:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-release-candidate-macos-tahoe-26-7-sequoia-15-8\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le seconde Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 e macOS Sequoia 15.8\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple distribuisce agli sviluppatori le seconde Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 e macOS Sequoia 15.8, a una settimana dalle prime. In parallelo arriva anche la beta 7 di macOS 27 Golden Gate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macos-tahoe-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-tahoe\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17013,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-video-nascosto-macos-tahoe-26-7\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere: il leak arriva da Apple con un video nascosto in macOS Tahoe 26.7\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 compare un breve video nascosto che mostra la Visual Intelligence in funzione su AirPods con fotocamere.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/airpods-con-fotocamera-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-con-fotocamera\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16983,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-ios-26-6-1-macos-tahoe-26-6-2-corretti-problemi-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.6.1 e macOS Tahoe 26.6.2: quasi 30 correzioni di sicurezza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito iOS 26.6.1, iPadOS 26.6.1 e macOS Tahoe 26.6.2 con quasi 30 correzioni di sicurezza, pensate per migliorare la protezione degli utenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-logo-768x430.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16979,\"date\":\"2026-08-19T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-19T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamera-prime-conferme-visual-intelligence\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamera: prime conferme e demo con Visual Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta lavorando a AirPods dotati di fotocamera. Una demo collegata a macOS Tahoe 26.7 RC mostra Visual Intelligence, Siri e avvisi per la copertura della camera.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-camera-airpods-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-camera-airpods\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16989,\"date\":\"2026-08-18T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-18T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-26-7-riferimenti-prodotti-apple-non-rilasciati\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.7: riferimenti a prodotti Apple non ancora rilasciati\",\"excerpt\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.7 include riferimenti a prodotti Apple non ancora annunciati o rilasciati, suggerendo attività di sviluppo in corso e possibili aggiornamenti futuri.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-AI-Command-Center-Concept-Mock-1-Textless-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-AI-Command-Center-Concept-Mock-1-Textless\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16852,\"date\":\"2026-08-11T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-11T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-macos-tahoe-26-6-2-fix-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta di macOS Tahoe 26.6.2 con fix di sicurezza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibile la beta di macOS Tahoe 26.6.2 per sviluppatori e tester pubblici. L’aggiornamento include fix di sicurezza e arriva pochi giorni dopo macOS Tahoe 26.6.1.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-Tahoe-26-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16801,\"date\":\"2026-08-07T08:33:07+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-07T06:33:07+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-macos-tahoe-26-6-1-con-aggiornamenti-di-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia macOS Tahoe 26.6.1 con aggiornamenti di sicurezza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato macOS Tahoe 26.6.1, un aggiornamento focalizzato su correzioni di sicurezza per migliorare la protezione del sistema.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-Tahoe-26-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16631,\"date\":\"2026-07-31T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-31T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"safari-technology-preview-249-bug-fix-miglioramenti-performance\",\"title\":\"Safari Technology Preview 249: bug fix e miglioramenti di performance\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia Safari Technology Preview 249 con correzioni e aggiornamenti su accessibilità, CSS, JavaScript, Web API e altri componenti. Compatibile con le nuove versioni di macOS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16629,\"date\":\"2026-07-31T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-31T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"pastebot-3-per-mac-organizzazione-con-regole-e-filtri-avanzati\",\"title\":\"Pastebot 3 per Mac: organizzazione con regole e filtri avanzati\",\"excerpt\":\"Pastebot 3 porta su macOS un’organizzazione automatica basata su regole, filtri potenti per i contenuti copiati e funzioni di automazione con Shortcuts e CLI.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/pastebot-3-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"pastebot-3\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16535,\"date\":\"2026-07-28T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-28T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"aggiorna-ora-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6-centinaia-falle-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Aggiorna ora: iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6 chiudono centinaia di falle di sicurezza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6 con numerose patch di sicurezza: quasi 90 vulnerabilità su iOS/iPadOS e oltre 130 su macOS, più aggiornamenti anche per tvOS, watchOS e visionOS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/apple-lock-security-bug-vulnerability-fix-privacy-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-lock-security-bug-vulnerability-fix-privacy\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16442,\"date\":\"2026-07-23T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-23T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"safari-technology-preview-248-bug-fix-performance\",\"title\":\"Safari Technology Preview 248: bug fix e miglioramenti di performance\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia Safari Technology Preview 248, l’aggiornamento sperimentale del browser per testare nuove funzionalità di Safari. Inclusi fix su accessibilità, CSS, JavaScript e altro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16395,\"date\":\"2026-07-22T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-22T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-release-candidate-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito agli sviluppatori la Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.6 per i test. L’aggiornamento è previsto in versione pubblica se non emergono bug critici.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16293,\"date\":\"2026-07-16T11:28:18+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-16T09:28:18+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-installare-beta-pubblica-macos-27-golden-gate\",\"title\":\"Come installare la beta pubblica di macOS 27 Golden Gate\",\"excerpt\":\"La prima beta pubblica di macOS 27 Golden Gate è disponibile per i test. Ecco cosa sapere prima di installarla, quali Mac sono compatibili e la procedura passo-passo.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/How-to-Install-macOS-27-Golden-Gate-Public-Beta-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"How-to-Install-macOS-27-Golden-Gate-Public-Beta-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16253,\"date\":\"2026-07-15T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-15T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-golden-gate-public-beta-10-funzioni-da-provare-subito\",\"title\":\"macOS Golden Gate Public Beta: 10 funzioni da provare subito\",\"excerpt\":\"La Public Beta di macOS 27 Golden Gate è disponibile: ecco 10 novità pratiche, da Siri AI e Visual Intelligence fino a miglioramenti di Safari, Spotlight e prestazioni generali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/macOS-27-Public-Beta-Thumb-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-Public-Beta-Thumb-2\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16206,\"date\":\"2026-07-13T21:42:32+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-13T19:42:32+00:00\",\"slug\":\"quinta-beta-macos-tahoe-26-6-disponibile-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"Quinta beta di macOS Tahoe 26.6 disponibile per gli sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato la quinta beta di macOS Tahoe 26.6 per i developer. L’aggiornamento arriva a una settimana dalla quarta beta e si scarica da Impostazioni di Sistema.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16036,\"date\":\"2026-07-08T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-08T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-4-ios-26-6-e-altri-sistemi-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 4 di iOS 26.6 e degli altri sistemi: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple mette a disposizione la quarta beta per sviluppatori di iOS 26.6, insieme alle nuove beta di iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e HomePod 26.6.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/ios-26.6-beta-4-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26.6-beta-4\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15958,\"date\":\"2026-07-03T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-03T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"opera-paste-protect-contro-comandi-malevoli-clipboard\",\"title\":\"Opera introduce “Paste Protect” contro i comandi malevoli dalla clipboard\",\"excerpt\":\"Opera ha annunciato Paste Protect, una nuova funzione di sicurezza integrata nei browser desktop per bloccare attacchi ClickFix basati su comandi malevoli copiati e incollati nel Terminale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Paste-Protect-opera-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Paste-Protect-opera\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15868,\"date\":\"2026-06-30T10:42:33+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-30T08:42:33+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-3-ios-26-6-novita\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 3 di iOS 26.6: novità su iPadOS, macOS, watchOS, tvOS e visionOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple distribuisce la beta 3 di iOS 26.6 e delle piattaforme collegate: iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ios-26.6-beta-3-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26.6-beta-3\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15835,\"date\":\"2026-06-29T20:58:12+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-29T18:58:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-macos-tahoe-26-5-2-aggiornamento-di-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia macOS Tahoe 26.5.2: aggiornamento di sicurezza\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato macOS Tahoe 26.5.2, un aggiornamento minore per macOS Tahoe con focus su correzioni di sicurezza. Disponibile da Impostazioni di Sistema.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macOS-Tahoe-26-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15689,\"date\":\"2026-06-23T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-23T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-26-5-2-ios-26-5-2-aggiornamenti-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.5.2 e iOS 26.5.2: aggiornamenti in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta lavorando a macOS Tahoe 26.5.2 e iOS 26.5.2, attesi a breve insieme. Si tratta di update minori orientati a correzioni e sicurezza, mentre sono già in test le versioni 26.6.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macos-tahoe-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-tahoe\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15634,\"date\":\"2026-06-20T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-20T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tre-novita-macos-27-iphone-mirroring-schermo-control-center-drm\",\"title\":\"Tre novità di macOS 27 per iPhone Mirroring: schermo, Control Center e DRM\",\"excerpt\":\"In macOS 27 Golden Gate arrivano aggiornamenti a iPhone Mirroring: supporto a più aspect ratio per ridimensionare la finestra, accesso al Control Center da tastiera e menu, e riproduzione di contenuti protetti DRM.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iphone-mirroring-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-mirroring-blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15553,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-tahoe-26-6-seconda-beta-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"macOS Tahoe 26.6: disponibile la seconda beta per sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato la seconda beta di macOS Tahoe 26.6 per gli sviluppatori. L’aggiornamento arriva quasi tre settimane dopo la prima beta e si scarica da Impostazioni > Aggiornamento software.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-Tahoe-26-Thumb-2\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15501,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"supporto-software-apple-interrompe-16-dispositivi-autunno\",\"title\":\"Supporto software in calo: Apple interrompe l’aggiornamento per 16 dispositivi\",\"excerpt\":\"In autunno Apple terminerà il supporto software per 16 dispositivi tra Apple Watch, iPad, Mac e Apple TV. I tagli più ampi riguardano Apple Watch, mentre macOS 27 sancisce la fine dei Mac Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Top-Half-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Top-Half\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15462,\"date\":\"2026-06-13T15:57:18+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-13T13:13:18+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-vedere-quali-app-intel-smetteranno-di-funzionare-dopo-macos-golden-gate\",\"title\":\"Come vedere quali app Intel smetteranno di funzionare dopo macOS Golden Gate\",\"excerpt\":\"macOS Golden Gate intensifica l’addio a Rosetta 2: le app che dipendono da Rosetta riceveranno avvisi e potranno essere verificate in una nuova lista nelle Impostazioni.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/rosetta-2-768x427.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"rosetta-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15368,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T19:57:55+00:00\",\"s